WEBVTT

00:41.200 --> 00:42.530
Doroka.

00:43.820 --> 00:45.260
Mia.

00:45.260 --> 00:47.020
I'm glad you're all right.

00:47.020 --> 00:50.530
Mia, what happened?

00:51.400 --> 00:52.840
I don't know.

00:53.290 --> 00:56.530
The humans suddenly attacked.

00:56.530 --> 01:00.530
But we got along so well until recently.

01:00.880 --> 01:05.290
We even went all the way to 
the city to cure Mr. Tom's illness.

01:05.290 --> 01:07.320
This can't be happening.

01:07.320 --> 01:09.320
I know! We can use magic.

01:09.320 --> 01:10.550
We can't.

01:10.550 --> 01:11.360
What?

01:12.690 --> 01:15.370
That machine is suppressing our magic.

01:15.800 --> 01:18.020
What is that?

01:18.020 --> 01:21.410
Madam Ophelia might know something.

01:22.050 --> 01:23.840
Doroka, run.

01:24.300 --> 01:29.570
You must tell Madam 
Ophelia what's happening.

01:30.120 --> 01:32.030
You want me to go alone?

01:32.030 --> 01:35.090
No, let's go together.

01:35.090 --> 01:37.080
Listen to me.

01:37.560 --> 01:40.330
You're a good girl.

01:42.570 --> 01:46.320
Mia, what did they do to you?

01:46.320 --> 01:51.910
Follow the Star of Revelation, 
and you'll reach Madam Ophelia's mansion.

01:52.330 --> 01:54.810
I took you there during 
the Fertility Festival.

01:54.810 --> 01:55.840
You know the way, right?

01:56.340 --> 01:57.530
Doroka.

01:58.280 --> 02:00.340
You're a strong girl.

02:00.340 --> 02:03.290
Run as quickly as you can, 
and no one will be able to catch you.

02:03.290 --> 02:06.720
You'll have crossed the mountains 
before you know it.

02:07.350 --> 02:09.520
Now go.

02:12.800 --> 02:13.850
Okay.

02:14.280 --> 02:16.860
Don't look back. Just run.

02:16.860 --> 02:19.860
You're a truly strong girl.

02:19.860 --> 02:23.430
So this is where the bitch ran off to.

02:24.610 --> 02:26.720
Let's resume our fun.

04:17.850 --> 04:18.990
Hey.

04:18.990 --> 04:21.450
I'm sorry.

04:23.240 --> 04:25.250
Wait! Don't die on me.

04:25.620 --> 04:27.070
How do I do it?

04:27.070 --> 04:29.760
How can I bring Chloe back to life?

04:33.460 --> 04:34.760
Listen to me.

04:35.470 --> 04:37.000
The witches are...

05:00.900 --> 05:03.630
Don't screw with me, witch.

05:03.630 --> 05:05.910
Bring Chloe back from the dead?

05:05.910 --> 05:10.400
That's not enough for
me to know what to do.

05:14.500 --> 05:17.040
The fiend is dead.

05:20.040 --> 05:22.800
It's over, Director Yamato.

05:23.900 --> 05:26.550
Don't get cocky, humans.

05:37.440 --> 05:39.440
Fire, fire!

06:09.980 --> 06:11.310
Cainz.

06:11.470 --> 06:13.560
<b>Cainz</b>

06:40.080 --> 06:41.300
Die.

07:00.340 --> 07:02.530
Written-Style Summoning Magic...

07:12.110 --> 07:15.530
<b>Maximum
Gaine</b>

07:13.390 --> 07:14.650
Maximum Gaine.

07:15.530 --> 07:16.740
Now die.

07:25.680 --> 07:27.800
Is he for real?

07:39.080 --> 07:41.430
Powerless insects.

07:42.350 --> 07:45.440
Did you think you had 
any chance of beating me?

07:46.110 --> 07:48.950
Did you really think you could beat magic?

07:49.550 --> 07:55.330
Did you think you could live 
in peace after killing Chloe?

07:55.330 --> 07:56.570
Fuck you!

07:58.570 --> 08:02.080
I'll wipe every last one of
you off the face of this planet.

08:04.370 --> 08:06.570
<i>You'll know Chloe's despair.</i>

08:07.620 --> 08:10.610
Hurry, Yuki.

08:14.840 --> 08:17.440
This is the DAM...

08:17.440 --> 08:21.100
The crown jewel of science 
that once defeated the witches.

08:21.100 --> 08:25.230
Once activated, we'll be 
able to suppress his magic.

08:26.180 --> 08:27.740
<i>Finally...</i>

08:29.120 --> 08:32.320
<i>I'll be useful to my brother.</i>

08:37.700 --> 08:39.630
Hurry up, you two!

08:39.630 --> 08:40.960
S-Sorry, ma'am!

08:42.320 --> 08:46.820
I knew the hot-blooded National 
Security Bureau would show up here.

08:46.820 --> 08:48.260
You're...

08:48.960 --> 08:52.210
One of the Four National Bureaus of 
the Redia Empire: The National Science Agency

08:52.510 --> 08:56.470
National Science Agency Director
\h\h\h\h\h\hTheta Samanstah

08:52.520 --> 08:57.470
Yuki, you've grown stronger 
since I last saw you.

08:57.840 --> 09:01.980
Unfortunately, I can't allow you 
to activate this device.

09:03.830 --> 09:05.610
What do you mean?

09:06.870 --> 09:08.790
I request an explanation.

09:12.730 --> 09:14.990
Yuki

09:16.720 --> 09:18.170
What is it, Yuki?

09:18.170 --> 09:19.980
Why haven't you activated the device yet?

09:20.480 --> 09:24.610
<i>Right now, you're about as calm
as boiling water, aren't you?</i>

09:24.610 --> 09:27.070
That voice... Director Theta.

09:27.070 --> 09:28.940
<i>Do you have a moment to speak?</i>

09:30.260 --> 09:32.000
Not currently.

09:33.160 --> 09:35.510
We're in a race against time.

09:35.510 --> 09:38.120
My phone!

09:36.960 --> 09:40.010
Don't be so on edge, Director Yamato.

09:41.350 --> 09:44.540
You can't activate the 
Magic Photon Suppression Device.

09:44.520 --> 09:44.640
Dear Brother

09:46.150 --> 09:47.360
<i>Why not?</i>

09:48.000 --> 09:52.760
Science is the work of humanity
 that sheds light on the world.

09:56.140 --> 09:59.890
But while we've explained
much about the world,

09:57.780 --> 10:03.790
Dear Brother

10:00.250 --> 10:03.250
there are still things 
we don't understand...

10:07.430 --> 10:11.540
Such as the particles emitted 
by the Magic Photon Suppression Device.

10:12.310 --> 10:14.160
So what?

10:14.560 --> 10:17.290
<i>Human Cellular Dysfunction Disease.</i>

10:17.760 --> 10:19.020
<i>Recognize the name?</i>

10:19.940 --> 10:25.080
It's the illness developed by soldiers who 
participated in the witch hunts ten years ago.

10:25.540 --> 10:27.070
What's that got to do with it?

10:27.070 --> 10:30.560
<i>We can't say for certain due to 
the large number of factors,</i>

10:31.120 --> 10:36.320
<i>but we believe these particles
affected the human body.</i>

10:43.480 --> 10:46.320
<i>This device kills cells.</i>

10:46.880 --> 10:48.450
That's news to me.

10:50.160 --> 10:52.180
Because we hid it.

10:55.770 --> 11:01.840
Unfortunately, there are no more witches 
left to restore the natural environment.

11:02.440 --> 11:06.060
The atmosphere that would've 
cleansed these harmful rays is gone.

11:07.840 --> 11:10.600
Nature has fallen out of grace.

11:10.600 --> 11:14.360
As things are now, if a human body were 
exposed to a massive amount of particles,

11:14.800 --> 11:17.050
it would be destroyed.

11:17.390 --> 11:18.990
<i>That can't be...</i>

11:20.490 --> 11:29.370
You know what happened to those who fought 
for humanity and stood before this device.

11:30.780 --> 11:34.090
Then His Majesty's illness is...

11:56.820 --> 11:58.400
Dear Brother

11:56.820 --> 12:00.260
Now you know. You should leave now.

12:02.150 --> 12:03.180
Yuki.

12:07.410 --> 12:08.410
Dear Brother

12:09.180 --> 12:11.820
Yuki! Wait!

12:12.480 --> 12:15.190
<i>We can't afford to worry about illnesses</i>

12:16.670 --> 12:19.600
<i>when the threat of magic is right before us.</i>

12:20.250 --> 12:22.680
Yuki, it's in your hands.

12:22.680 --> 12:23.960
This is of national importance.

12:23.960 --> 12:24.720
Yes, sir.

12:29.000 --> 12:31.430
All units, retreat. Quickly.

12:33.120 --> 12:34.760
Yuki, wait!

12:35.060 --> 12:37.030
Didn't you hear what I said?

12:37.820 --> 12:39.710
Don't activate that device!

12:39.710 --> 12:42.070
Even a little exposure 
could have consequences.

12:42.070 --> 12:43.340
Yuki!

12:44.070 --> 12:46.070
This is of national importance,

12:47.880 --> 12:49.080
Brother.

13:05.490 --> 13:06.270
Huh?

13:11.920 --> 13:14.760
The target has dropped the quill, Director.

13:16.110 --> 13:19.770
What happened, Director Theta? How is Yuki?

13:22.360 --> 13:25.040
It was nothing.

13:25.670 --> 13:27.550
Everything's fine here.

13:28.410 --> 13:31.660
Dear Brother

13:28.410 --> 13:31.660
<i>Did Yuki do something? Could it be...?</i>

13:31.950 --> 13:34.540
Look in front of you, kid!

13:37.420 --> 13:40.290
<i>Is this really someone you can't beat 
without suppressing magic?</i>

13:40.570 --> 13:43.050
<i>Should we really be having 
this much trouble with that boy?</i>

13:44.050 --> 13:46.250
<i>What should you be doing?</i>

13:47.120 --> 13:51.010
Quickly exterminating 
those who harm the empire.

13:51.370 --> 13:52.330
<i>Yes.</i>

13:53.200 --> 13:57.010
We are Redia, the indestructible empire.

14:00.790 --> 14:03.280
All units, charge!

14:13.040 --> 14:14.220
Aim!

14:15.450 --> 14:17.940
Hey, stay out of the line of fire!

14:20.420 --> 14:22.790
How dare you harm our nation.

14:22.790 --> 14:24.870
Stay away from him.

14:38.810 --> 14:40.990
Thermo blade on!

14:42.560 --> 14:45.070
Witch's apprentice, my ass!

14:46.890 --> 14:49.040
<i>Am I going to die?</i>

14:50.410 --> 14:53.570
<i>I get to die?</i>

14:54.720 --> 14:58.590
<i>Finally, I can be with you.</i>

15:12.850 --> 15:14.700
Is that soldier all right?

15:14.700 --> 15:16.840
I can't see because of all the smoke.

15:17.410 --> 15:19.350
Hey, look.

15:28.690 --> 15:31.370
I did it.

15:33.770 --> 15:35.600
I killed the witch's apprentice.

15:45.920 --> 15:49.390
All right! He's dead!

15:49.390 --> 15:51.570
What forces are you with?

15:51.570 --> 15:53.140
Nice work.

15:53.140 --> 15:55.600
They defeated the witch's apprentice?

15:56.010 --> 15:58.170
This is the power of Redia!

15:58.170 --> 16:00.020
Serves you right!

16:05.900 --> 16:07.680
This is Yamato of the NSB.

16:07.680 --> 16:09.760
Well done, everyone.

16:10.220 --> 16:12.720
Good work defeating the witch's apprentice.

16:13.280 --> 16:15.750
But don't celebrate yet.

16:16.280 --> 16:21.660
Collect his body and confirm 
the damage done to each area of the city.

16:22.290 --> 16:26.770
Link up with the rescue crews, 
and help the victims.

16:28.470 --> 16:30.520
It was that soldier who killed him.

16:31.300 --> 16:32.620
She's so young.

16:33.000 --> 16:35.790
I believe she's a new recruit 
of the armored foot soldiers.

16:35.790 --> 16:36.820
I'll look into it.

16:36.820 --> 16:37.840
Don't bother.

16:38.500 --> 16:42.590
See how Director Theta 
and Vice-Director Yuki are doing.

16:42.590 --> 16:43.410
On the double.

16:43.410 --> 16:44.410
Yes, sir.

16:45.640 --> 16:49.320
<i>You're right, Director Theta.</i>

16:50.180 --> 16:53.790
<i>We are... This nation is strong.</i>

17:03.830 --> 17:06.330
Magic survived.

17:06.920 --> 17:11.230
Those abominable occult arts 
still remained in this world.

17:12.040 --> 17:17.340
That boy we took from the witch's hands ten 
years ago has been unleashed upon the world.

17:17.660 --> 17:20.370
It's the worst possible outcome.

17:21.340 --> 17:22.800
This is truly a disaster.

17:23.600 --> 17:28.780
Long-term prisoner 
and witch's apprentice, Adonis.

17:29.440 --> 17:32.160
Despite being human like us,

17:32.160 --> 17:38.610
that fiend was a remnant of 
the terrible old world enthralled by magic.

17:38.620 --> 17:47.620
Even after ten years, we've failed to 
determine how he used magic as a human.

17:48.560 --> 17:56.690
Looking back, I cannot help 
but feel enraged that I allowed him to live.

17:56.690 --> 17:59.260
But fear not, my people.

17:59.260 --> 18:05.120
This is Redia, the pinnacle of the world.

18:05.520 --> 18:08.220
The power of science we've acquired

18:08.230 --> 18:13.910
and our iron-willed troops 
will yield to no evil.

18:14.400 --> 18:17.890
Let the flames of pride burn in our hearts.

18:18.520 --> 18:23.000
Be proud you were born 
human in the Redia Empire.

18:23.390 --> 18:27.710
The old world is gone. God is dead.

18:27.710 --> 18:30.550
This nation is now God.

18:32.500 --> 18:34.050
[Disaster] Memorial Service Speech
His Imperial Majesty, Emperor Goethe
of the Redia Empire

18:43.180 --> 18:48.520
A few of our students died, 
and I know things haven't been easy,

18:48.870 --> 18:50.780
But the national mock exams start tomorrow.

18:50.780 --> 18:51.890
Let's move past this.

18:52.190 --> 18:53.520
Got it?

18:53.970 --> 18:56.060
Okay, homeroom is over.

18:56.060 --> 18:57.280
Sir.

18:57.280 --> 19:03.030
Why did the witch's apprentice side 
with the witches if he's human?

19:03.030 --> 19:04.300
Who knows?

19:04.300 --> 19:06.320
He was probably brainwashed or something.

19:07.200 --> 19:10.790
Oh, first period is PE. Get changed quickly.

19:17.720 --> 19:19.550
I saw you.

19:21.190 --> 19:22.530
I saw what you did.

19:23.430 --> 19:24.290
What?

19:24.290 --> 19:27.020
What's your problem? You're so annoying.

19:27.020 --> 19:29.110
That was a normal reaction 
to that situation.

19:29.690 --> 19:31.920
Eri, hurry up.

19:31.920 --> 19:34.680
Yamane's a drag if you're late.

19:41.740 --> 19:43.650
Die, you ugly bitch.

19:55.860 --> 19:57.600
Disaster, my ass.

19:58.400 --> 20:00.410
Do your damn jobs and protect the citizens.

20:02.200 --> 20:04.220
Sorry, Takuma.

20:05.530 --> 20:07.820
<i>You must hate me.</i>

20:07.820 --> 20:09.720
Eri! Eri!

20:10.220 --> 20:13.230
Eri, I'm screwed! Pull me out!

20:13.230 --> 20:15.720
What are you doing, Takuma?

20:17.870 --> 20:18.800
Huh?

20:19.770 --> 20:20.820
Eri?

20:21.610 --> 20:22.780
I'm so sorry.

20:23.610 --> 20:26.120
What? Wait, Eri!

20:26.560 --> 20:28.120
You're abandoning me?

20:28.120 --> 20:32.620
You're the one who said 
you had feelings for me!

20:40.500 --> 20:42.520
I suck.

20:44.530 --> 20:46.770
I abandoned my boyfriend,

20:47.740 --> 20:50.430
and I think this guy using magic...

20:53.570 --> 20:56.230
is kinda hot.

20:54.880 --> 20:56.230
Now that's shameful.

20:59.440 --> 21:02.110
Sorry, sorry. Looks like I scared you.

21:03.760 --> 21:05.460
<i>He's with the government.</i>

21:08.110 --> 21:09.320
It's okay.

21:09.320 --> 21:10.920
You don't have to delete those.

21:10.920 --> 21:13.090
You like those photos, right?

21:13.460 --> 21:16.280
But don't tell anyone about them.

21:16.280 --> 21:19.960
The witch's apprentice is the heinous 
criminal who caused that disaster.

21:21.180 --> 21:23.280
Don't be so scared.

21:23.280 --> 21:25.120
I won't snitch on you.

21:25.120 --> 21:27.430
R-Right. I'm sorry.

21:27.430 --> 21:29.960
I'd better go.

21:33.930 --> 21:36.080
It's me, Oz.

21:36.870 --> 21:40.400
There's a high school girl running 
down Gran Road from Section 6-2.

21:40.400 --> 21:43.170
She seems to have been 
influenced by the terrorist.

21:43.780 --> 21:45.480
Seize her.

21:46.680 --> 21:48.070
I don't know.

21:48.070 --> 21:50.870
Let the National Security 
Bureau handle the rest.

21:50.870 --> 21:55.180
She'll probably either be executed 
or imprisoned for treason.

21:55.180 --> 21:58.500
Chief Oz, there you are.

21:59.310 --> 22:01.750
We've completed the final check.

22:02.540 --> 22:05.030
Then I'll head back now.

22:06.990 --> 22:09.520
Inspecting the disaster area 
is pretty exhausting.

22:07.300 --> 22:10.010
National Intelligence Agency Deputy Director
\h\h\h\h\hChief Oz Gorgeous

22:10.010 --> 22:15.260
Give me a hug and kiss 
when I get back, Ms. Charmy.

22:16.360 --> 22:17.760
Chief Oz...

22:18.400 --> 22:22.660
Could you please address 
my transfer request soon?

22:22.660 --> 22:25.890
If you don't, I'm contacting 
the Labor Standards Office.

22:26.630 --> 22:29.760
Overtime every day and a boss who abuses 
their power and sexually harasses me.

22:29.760 --> 22:33.280
Why is our department the one 
with terrible working conditions?

22:33.280 --> 22:38.310
Anyway, some unbelievable 
analysis just came in.

22:33.830 --> 22:38.540
National Intelligence Agency
\h\h\h\h\hChief Investigator Charmy

22:38.310 --> 22:41.790
If you could return right away, please.

22:42.760 --> 22:44.820
<i>What's the gist?</i>

22:44.820 --> 22:46.290
Roger that.

22:48.570 --> 22:50.800
The witch's apprentice's body...

22:51.400 --> 22:52.640
is a fake.
